      "understanding": {
        "goal_understanding": "Navigate the grid, modify the carried piece's shape, color, and rotation as needed, and step onto every goal cell while all three attributes match its requirements. Completing all goals advances through the levels and winning every level completes the game.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move costs stamina, while reaching zero stamina costs a life and restores maximum stamina; losing all lives ends the game. Walls block movement, so blocked_directions must be checked before every move. Shape modifiers cycle shapes 0\u20135, color modifiers cycle orange to blue to green to red and back to orange, and rotation modifiers rotate clockwise through 0\u00b0, 90\u00b0, 180\u00b0, and 270\u00b0. A goal activates only when shape, color, and rotation match simultaneously, and stepping onto an activated goal completes it."
      }
